estimated_minutes: 720
acceptance_criteria: "A trajectory is readable scoped to an episode or a session, ordered by a sound causal order rather than wall-clock timestamp alone; Each step carries the observation boundary in force, the recorded mutation, the recording identity including harness, model and effort where available, and any verdict change that followed; Output is line-delimited rows read in constant memory at any trajectory length, and a cursor resumes an interrupted read; The projection is derived and recomputable from history alone: a rebuilt index and a fresh read produce identical trajectories, and no trajectory row is ever authoritative; Redacted history content never resurfaces in a trajectory export, proven by a test that redacts an entry and re-reads a trajectory covering it; The read is bounded by a declared token budget like every other read surface, and degrades rather than emitting unbounded output"
parent: pm-o2kc
